OL,3,GNEWSABeaver pair has new home at animal
OL,4,Asanctuary
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal sanctuary has announced the
OL,7,Farrival of two beavers.
OL,9,FThe beavers, named after famous
OL,10,Fconservationists Steve and Terri Irwin,
OL,11,Farrived at the Cornish Seal Sanctuary
OL,12,Fin Gweek, Cornwall, at the end of
OL,13,FSeptember.
OL,15,FSean Higgins, the sanctuary's property
OL,16,Fand conservation manager, said Steve
OL,17,Fand Terri's arrival was an "exciting
OL,18,Fmoment" and staff looked forward to
OL,19,Fwatching them settle in and getting to
OL,20,Fknow their personalities.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
